  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "１００トンの　せきせつを　あやつる。なだれを　おこして　そのなかをではいりして　むじゃきに　あそぶ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "100t의 눈을 조종한다. 눈사태를 일으키고는 그 안을 드나들며 천진난만하게 논다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能操控１００噸的積雪。會自由進出在自己引起的雪崩裡，天真無邪地玩耍。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon peut contrôler 100 tonnes de neige tombée. Il s’amuse en sautant joyeusement dans les avalanches qu’il provoque.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Baojian kann bis zu 100 t Schnee kontrollieren. In den Lawinen, die es auslöst, tollt es ganz arglos herum.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Controla a su voluntad masas de nieve de hasta cien toneladas. Se divierte zambulléndose y saltando felizmente en los aludes que provoca.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Può controllare ammassi di neve pesanti anche cento tonnellate. Gioca spensierato saltando in mezzo alle valanghe che lui stesso causa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon can control 100 tons of fallen snow. It plays around innocently by leaping in and out of avalanches it has caused.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "１００トンの　積雪を　操る。雪崩を　起こして　その中を出入りして　無邪気に　遊ぶ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会操控１００吨的积雪。在自己引起的雪崩中自由进出，天真无邪地玩耍。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Controla a su voluntad masas de nieve de hasta cien toneladas. Se divierte zambulléndose y saltando felizmente en los aludes que provoca.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおむかしに　つるぎによって　つゆときえたものたちの　にくしみがゆきを　まとい　ポケモンになった。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "먼 옛날, 검에 의해 이슬이 되어 사라진 자들의 증오가 눈을 두르고 포켓몬이 되었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "遙遠過去喪命於劍下者的憎恨之情纏繞在雪上，變成了寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La haine de personnes ayant jadis succombé au fil de l’épée s’est mêlée à de la neige et a pris vie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Hass derjenigen, die vor langer Zeit durch das Schwert umkamen, hüllte sich in Schnee und wurde zu diesem Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon nació al imbuirse en las nieves el odio que sentían aquellos que perecieron ante la espada en tiempos inmemoriales.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Prese vita quando l’odio degli antichi che perirono a causa della spada si ammantò di neve.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The hatred of those who perished by the sword long ago has clad itself in snow and become a Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大昔に　剣によって　露と消えた者たちの　憎しみが雪を　まとい　ポケモンになった。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "很久以前，丧命于剑下者的憎恨之情缠绕在雪上，变成了宝可梦。",
